        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Brought a huge load of metal coils from Trois Rivières to Stephenville Newfoundland. For being a first time client of there’s and not having any XP in getting a huge shipment like this ,I was treated like I was doing business with them for years ,Kelly Oshimo was with us every step of the way with informative updates and explaining it to us in a way we could understand.\n\nThank you Insignia Transport\nIt’s nice to know there is businesses out there that don’t try and take advantage of you for not really being too knowledgeable in logistics.",
        "time": 1684259098,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Indira Ivojevic",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109665255235119800419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmI9iOnEy3KM2oliwCrqXPcVrB9oAO052NXOLBVMGw5eLveQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "Insignia Tranport is one the best trucking company that I ever worked with. I have been in freight forwarding/transportation business for years, and I am always looking for someone not only to get the job done, but to do  it well, on time and without any problems. You can count on them, their professional level and friendly staff, you can give them a load and step back and relax, they will deliver freight to your client without any issues. Great for shipments from Canada to USA,  Great job!",
        "time": 1465915372,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josh Nash",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101224243214368369603/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdUI4t61VKn2MDjiNGfrrPLAB2LOK2PWsj4Pec9HEuSegJLaU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very happy and fortunate to find this company\nPrices were fair and beat competitors by quite a bit ,thank you for your honesty with our shipment\nWe will be using them again that’s for sure",
